#: ../../architecture.rst:2 c454f3928e374e51941bc9bf82df8f13
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "아키텍처"

#: ../../architecture.rst:5 499bca416e8848abb7a64cc893480686
msgid "Source layout"
msgstr "소스 구조"

#: ../../architecture.rst:7 c1cb42e5ba8e45ffa0ac32b33c0f5ec1
msgid "All of the plugin's logic lives under ``src/``:"
msgstr "플러그인의 모든 로직은 ``src/`` 아래에 있습니다:"

#: ../../architecture.rst:13 ba1efc61dc844b89b6b1fa6c99d3c0fb
msgid "File"
msgstr "파일"

#: ../../architecture.rst:14 f6a916fde8b14751b2953751b4dab960
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "역할"

#: ../../architecture.rst:15 c09e1679c05e4d7d9dff93cf8144e686
msgid "``main.ts``"
msgstr "``main.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:16 1a47fbe8d873481ba3329a9c61beec15
msgid ""
"Plugin entry point: loads settings, wires up the settings tab, editor "
"suggest, live preview extension, and post-processor; adds the **Refresh "
"contacts** command."
msgstr ""
"플러그인 진입점: 설정을 불러오고, 설정 탭·에디터 서제스트·라이브 프리뷰 익스텐션·포스트 프로세서를 연결하며, **주소록 "
"새로고침** 명령을 추가합니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:19 dc92656b1e8f4ae9a65c58d885e3eb6e
msgid "``types.ts``"
msgstr "``types.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:20 c0c0a01c88b3434fb40ebcc1eac18377
msgid "Shared types: ``Contact``, ``CardDavProfile``, ``HarangContactsSettings``."
msgstr "공용 타입: ``Contact``, ``CardDavProfile``, ``HarangContactsSettings``."

#: ../../architecture.rst:22 39d65f3e69a54575bf07f19c3dfc1f34
msgid "``settings.ts`` / ``settingsTab.ts``"
msgstr "``settings.ts`` / ``settingsTab.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:23 ae0685fb7e1c46199dd6ca79a4e927be
msgid ""
"Default settings and the settings UI. ``settingsTab.ts`` implements "
"Obsidian's classic imperative ``display()`` API rather than the newer "
"declarative ``getSettingDefinitions()`` API (1.13.0+), so the settings UI"
" works on Obsidian versions below 1.13.0 too."
msgstr ""
"기본 설정값과 설정 UI입니다. ``settingsTab.ts``\\ 는 1.13.0+에서 도입된 새 선언형 "
"``getSettingDefinitions()`` API 대신 기존의 명령형 ``display()`` API를 구현합니다. "
"그래서 설정 UI가 1.13.0 미만 Obsidian 버전에서도 동작합니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:27 33f76d0e17694a03b50e4f07bc0d325b
msgid "``i18n.ts``"
msgstr "``i18n.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:28 e70cedd21df34d13ac362a3f8c4a62aa
msgid ""
"Looks up the current Obsidian UI language via the official "
"``getLanguage()`` API and returns matching strings from a small "
"``ko``/``en`` dictionary (falling back to English)."
msgstr ""
"Obsidian 공식 ``getLanguage()`` API로 현재 UI 언어를 조회하고, 작은 ``ko``/``en`` 사전에서 "
"일치하는 문자열을 반환합니다(없으면 영어로 대체)."

#: ../../architecture.rst:31 c24a349aaf7b421eaf86c52fad172920
msgid "``carddav/client.ts``"
msgstr "``carddav/client.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:32 8155cd4ed4c64dc790d431b194e6e201
msgid ""
"A minimal read-only CardDAV client: address book discovery (``PROPFIND"
"``/``current-user-principal``/``addressbook-home-set``) and contact "
"fetching (``REPORT`` ``addressbook-query``), over Obsidian's "
"``requestUrl``."
msgstr ""
"최소한의 읽기 전용 CardDAV 클라이언트입니다: Obsidian의 ``requestUrl``\\ 을 통해 주소록 "
"탐색(``PROPFIND``/``current-user-principal``/``addressbook-home-set``)과 연락처"
" 조회(``REPORT`` ``addressbook-query``)를 수행합니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:36 118616f7e3074d278e2df467e6596dae
msgid "``carddav/vcard.ts``"
msgstr "``carddav/vcard.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:37 294c8ab6d72b46ee96dd4d68ad8fbe2e
msgid ""
"A small vCard 3/4 parser extracting ``FN``, ``UID``, ``EMAIL``, ``TEL``, "
"and ``ORG`` into a ``Contact``."
msgstr ""
"vCard 3/4를 파싱해 ``FN``, ``UID``, ``EMAIL``, ``TEL``, ``ORG``\\ 를 "
"``Contact``\\ 로 추출하는 작은 파서입니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:39 7f12d20bd6be401594a7dd4a718ba332
msgid "``carddav/store.ts``"
msgstr "``carddav/store.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:40 772bf729ea6d47d6ac80378e4607e938
msgid ""
"``ContactStore``: merges and caches contacts from every configured "
"profile, with TTL-based staleness and search/lookup helpers."
msgstr ""
"``ContactStore``: 설정된 모든 프로필의 연락처를 병합·캐시하며, TTL 기반 신선도 판단과 검색/조회 헬퍼를 "
"제공합니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:42 c0fdcfbf5b344f1684a91d3c89f92b07
msgid "``editorSuggest.ts``"
msgstr "``editorSuggest.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:43 3e18db7af4b549ca9eedd7f2c160a8cf
msgid ""
"``ContactEditorSuggest``: triggers on ``@contact[``, searches the cached "
"contact store, and inserts the selected contact's reference."
msgstr ""
"``ContactEditorSuggest``: ``@contact[``\\ 에서 트리거되어, 캐시된 연락처 스토어를 검색하고 선택된"
" 연락처의 참조를 삽입합니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:45 ca1d1d4d73e84210ba1931e443c2733e
msgid "``render/contactRef.ts``"
msgstr "``render/contactRef.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:46 a3208b96a45e47c4987a2957fbe44b87
msgid ""
"Parses and formats the ``name|profileId|uid`` reference syntax, and "
"resolves a reference back to a ``Contact`` (falling back to a name-only "
"search if the UID is no longer in the cache)."
msgstr ""
"``name|profileId|uid`` 참조 문법을 파싱·생성하고, 참조를 다시 ``Contact``\\ 로 해석합니다(UID가 "
"더 이상 캐시에 없으면 이름 검색으로 대체)."

#: ../../architecture.rst:49 e90eb8a6a2b64253b5af872f88e85fa8
msgid "``render/livePreview.ts``"
msgstr "``render/livePreview.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:50 d729420c01af4ead942d670e2d041b75
msgid ""
"A CodeMirror 6 ``ViewPlugin`` that replaces ``@contact[...]`` ranges with"
" chip widgets in Live Preview, skipping ranges the cursor or selection "
"currently overlaps so the raw syntax stays editable."
msgstr ""
"라이브 프리뷰에서 ``@contact[...]`` 범위를 칩 위젯으로 치환하는 CodeMirror 6 ``ViewPlugin``\\"
" 입니다. 커서나 선택 영역이 겹치는 범위는 건너뛰어 원문 문법을 계속 편집할 수 있게 합니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:53 4bfcb980bf094604bea01ebb5f99f2f9
msgid "``render/postProcessor.ts``"
msgstr "``render/postProcessor.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:54 4bf5757dc38c420bbe5f919e44e74139
msgid ""
"A Markdown post-processor that does the same replacement for Reading "
"view, by walking rendered text nodes."
msgstr "렌더링된 텍스트 노드를 순회하며 읽기 모드에서 동일한 치환을 수행하는 마크다운 포스트 프로세서입니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:56 8124fe046e9a4460a081e40fe4436a76
msgid "``render/chip.ts`` / ``render/card.ts``"
msgstr "``render/chip.ts`` / ``render/card.ts``"

#: ../../architecture.rst:57 fa38a22bf1ee48afa102e5f5cb061bf9
msgid ""
"The chip DOM element, and the click-to-open detail card (a manually "
"positioned floating panel, closed on outside click or Esc)."
msgstr "칩 DOM 엘리먼트와, 클릭 시 열리는 상세 카드(직접 위치를 계산하는 플로팅 패널이며, 바깥 클릭이나 Esc로 닫힘)입니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:62 df539be20418483f82c38f8bd0ac0da7
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "데이터 흐름"

#: ../../architecture.rst:87 4d764534efcd4eaf8094e87c9d2e5b18
msgid "Reference syntax"
msgstr "참조 문법"

#: ../../architecture.rst:89 7e0f6f04265a4997b4ed601eddaaa9ac
msgid ""
"A resolved reference is stored as ``@contact[name|profileId|uid]``. Only "
"``name`` is shown in the rendered chip; ``profileId`` and ``uid`` are "
"used to look the contact up precisely, so two contacts that happen to "
"share a display name (on the same server or different ones) never get "
"confused with each other. References typed by hand without the "
"``|profileId|uid`` suffix still resolve, by falling back to a plain name "
"search."
msgstr ""
"확정된 참조는 ``@contact[name|profileId|uid]`` 형태로 저장됩니다. 렌더링된 칩에는 ``name``\\ 만"
" 표시되고, ``profileId``\\ 와 ``uid``\\ 는 연락처를 정확히 찾는 데 사용됩니다. 그래서 (같은 서버든 다른 "
"서버든) 표시 이름이 우연히 같은 두 연락처가 서로 혼동되는 일이 없습니다. ``|profileId|uid`` 접미사 없이 손으로 "
"입력한 참조도, 이름만으로 검색하는 방식으로 대체되어 정상적으로 해석됩니다."

#: ../../architecture.rst:97 610f0b17fa56451dacbdf8b0eb7bf758
msgid "No runtime dependencies"
msgstr "런타임 의존성 없음"

#: ../../architecture.rst:99 6d886c9a33894709bff72bb6cf3fd0a6
msgid ""
"Beyond what Obsidian itself provides (the ``obsidian`` package, "
"CodeMirror 6), the plugin has no runtime dependencies — the CardDAV "
"client and vCard parser are both hand-written rather than pulled in from "
"npm, keeping the bundle small and avoiding exposure to a third-party "
"HTTP/XML parsing library's own vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"Obsidian 자체가 제공하는 것(``obsidian`` 패키지, CodeMirror 6) 외에는 런타임 의존성이 없습니다 — "
"CardDAV 클라이언트와 vCard 파서 모두 npm에서 가져오지 않고 직접 작성해, 번들 크기를 작게 유지하고 서드파티 "
"HTTP/XML 파싱 라이브러리 자체의 취약점에 노출될 일을 없앴습니다."

